{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/TopOfThePageAsset.png?t=1742559760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See the world through the eyes of a bee! Explore a world inspired by Central Park as you gather pollen, evade threats, and build your own thriving beehive. This edition combines the original Bee Simulator with The Hive expansion, introducing new mechanics, game modes, and fresh as spring pollen content\u2014all in one buzzing adventure, perfect for players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/Headline_1.png?t=1742559760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/EMBARK_ON_BIG_ADVENTURES_AS_A_LITTLE_BEE.gif?t=1742559760\" />Take flight in a heartwarming single-player story where you must protect your hive from looming danger. As one of the swarm\u2019s most diligent workers, your tiny wings will carry the fate of your entire colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/Headline_2.png?t=1742559760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/EXPLORE_A_VIBRANT__WORLD-FAMOUS_PARK.gif?t=1742559760\" />Fly around and explore every nook and cranny of a vast, semi-open world map inspired by New York\u2019s famous Central Park. From ponds to picnic grounds, funfairs to the zoo, you\u2019ll uncover secrets, mini-games, and resources throughout. Find people, animals, plants, and other insects to interact with along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/Headline_3.png?t=1742559760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/BUILD_YOUR_OWN_SPRAWLING_HIVE.gif?t=1742559760\" />The Hive expansion lets you build and customize your very own beehive from the ground up. Optimize your resource-gathering to collect what you need to create a buzzing home. Use a variety of practical and decorative buildings to bring your hive to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/Headline_4.png?t=1742559760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/MINI-GAMES_GALORE.gif?t=1742559760\" />Being a bee means non-stop activity! Race through jet streams, collect pollen, perform bee dances, defend your colony from wasps, and tackle various challenges in an exciting mix of exploration and action-packed gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/Headline_5.png?t=1742559760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/SPLIT_SCREEN_COOP.gif?t=1742559760\" />Team up with up to four friends or family in split-screen co-op. Play through custom-designed multiplayer maps with both cooperative and competitive game modes\u2014fun for everyone, young and old!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/Headline_6.png?t=1742559760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Soar through the world with a peaceful and immersive soundtrack composed by Miko\u0142aj Stroi\u0144ski, renowned for his work on The Witcher 3 and The Vanishing of Ethan Carter.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3348910?t=1742559760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/90406e34bf8f9c90183d983fec782baa09e09764/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742559760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/388f5eea9de8ed8bbc25fc08260f48724dd26edd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742559760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/388f5eea9de8ed8bbc25fc08260f48724dd26edd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742559760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/TopOfThePageAsset.png?t=1742559760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See the world through the eyes of a bee! Explore a world inspired by Central Park as you gather pollen, evade threats, and build your own thriving beehive. This edition combines the original Bee Simulator with The Hive expansion, introducing new mechanics, game modes, and fresh as spring pollen content\u2014all in one buzzing adventure, perfect for players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">