bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/Headline_4.png?t=1742559760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/MINI-GAMES_GALORE.gif?t=1742559760\" />Being a bee means non-stop activity! Race through jet streams, collect pollen, perform bee dances, defend your colony from wasps, and tackle various challenges in an exciting mix of exploration and action-packed gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/Headline_5.png?t=1742559760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/SPLIT_SCREEN_COOP.gif?t=1742559760\" />Team up with up to four friends or family in split-screen co-op. Play through custom-designed multiplayer maps with both cooperative and competitive game modes\u2014fun for everyone, young and old!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/extras/Headline_6.png?t=1742559760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Soar through the world with a peaceful and immersive soundtrack composed by Miko\u0142aj Stroi\u0144ski, renowned for his work on The Witcher 3 and The Vanishing of Ethan Carter.</p>","developers":["VARSAV Game Studios"],"dlc":[3514170],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348910/8bc5556eafc02fc13c819141bac50116c231ff56/header.jpg?t=1742559760","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</s